        <label>megasloth belly</label>
        <description>Slabs of meat from the soft belly of a megasloth. Renowned for the thick layer of fatty tissue.\n\n&lt;color=#6e6e6eff&gt;Being primarily herbivorous, the meat of megasloths acquires an intense, aromatic flavor, which only grows stronger as the animal ages. Some venators swear by megasloth belly as the most delicious raw meat one could get their fangs on.&lt;/color&gt;</description>
